{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13220570","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13220570","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322057001:1":{"text":"あら……すっかり話し込んじゃって、正式なお詫びもまだだったわね。","source_cn":"啊……说了这么多，都忘了向你们正式道歉了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0362A842E8279EDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322057002:1":{"text":"今回のスノーシダー町の騒動は、ダイモンと私の監督不行き届きが招いた結果だわ。勝手に家を抜け出して、夜中に町の子たちを連れ出すなんて、親たちはとても心配したでしょう。","source_cn":"这次雪松镇的恐慌，说到底是因为戴蒙和我管教不严才引发的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9187175C7CE6DBDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322057003:1":{"text":"さあ、ダイモン、公国の人たちに謝りなさい。","source_cn":"来吧，戴蒙，向白山公国的各位道个歉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6417EBF41AFEAC76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322057004:1":{"text":"ごめんなさい。ぼ、僕、悪いことしちゃった……","source_cn":"对不起……大哥哥、大姐姐……我、我做错了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD9FA0E9EDF62C45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322057005:1":{"text":"私からも、改めて謝罪するわ。この前はついカッとなってしまって……でもあの時は本当に、息子が心配だったのよ。","source_cn":"我也要向你们再次道歉，我上次的行为太冲动。希望你们能体...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA49DD1F84E741F64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322057006:0":{"text":"ダイモン、今回の騒動を起こした罰として、しばらくキキを没収するわ。","source_cn":"戴蒙，因为这次引起的恐慌，我决定没收你的玩偶傀儡一段时间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD85C28B4A97F682C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322057007:0":{"text":"あの子がいなければ、あなたも子どもたちを連れ出せないでしょう……お願いだがら、その間は私たちのそばで大人しくしていてちょうだい。","source_cn":"没有了它，你就没法再带镇上的孩子出来……求求你，这段时...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA17CB8BABD1ED3B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322057008:0":{"text":"え……ケホッ、キキを？ママ！キキを連れていかないで！","source_cn":"什么……咳，没收奇奇？妈妈！不要带走奇奇好不好？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55828A19A60F1799","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322057009:0":{"text":"没収するのは大きい方だけよ。あの子がいたら、また子どもたちと遊びに行くかもしれないでしょう？あなたが抱いている小さい人形は取り上げないわ。昔みたいに、その子を抱っこしていれば平気でしょう？","source_cn":"我只会没收你的大玩偶傀儡，如果留着大奇奇给你，你就一定...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D9B6819E2B710DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1322057010:0":{"text":"それに、ほんの少しの間だけよ。少ししたら返してあげるから。","source_cn":"而且我不会没收太久，过一段时间，我就把它还给你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x164F6FB624F88DEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1322057011:0":{"text":"でも、でも……ママ、お願いだよ……キキはたった一人の友だちなんだ！","source_cn":"可是、可是……妈妈，求求你……奇奇是我唯一的朋友了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05613011CF4489E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1322057012:0":{"text":"パパ、お願い、ママにキキを連れていかないでって言って……","source_cn":"爸爸，求你不要让妈妈带走奇奇……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE94803CE748E59F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1322057013:0":{"text":"う、シェミーラ……？","source_cn":"呃，吾爱……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x096E2B6F61867C21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1322057014:0":{"text":"一度言ったことは変えないって知ってるでしょう。","source_cn":"你知道我不会改主意的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA74E9F4516056DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1322057015:0":{"text":"これもあなたの安全のためなのよ、ダイモン。騒動が落ち着くまでは、どこにも行ってはダメ。分かった？","source_cn":"这是为了你的安全，戴蒙。在事态彻底平息之前，哪里都不要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4DD50BBBB69E388","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1322057016:0":{"text":"わ、分かった……","source_cn":"我……我知道了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA54B31A3F9F9828","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1322057017:0":{"text":"ぐすっ……","source_cn":"呜……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA73E62D95A4E1B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:21:1322057018:0":{"text":"ダイモンは頷きながら、黙って涙を拭うと、仮住まいにしている棺桶の中に入っていった。","source_cn":"戴蒙一边点头，他默默擦着眼泪，钻回了作为临时居所的棺材里","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DD2A3C0B974170D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1322057019:0":{"text":"泣いているようだけど……","source_cn":"……戴蒙？他在哭……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x396DE19CEEF8A4DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1322057020:0":{"text":"子どもは感情が高ぶりやすいのよ。私だって、あの子の涙を見ると心が痛むわ……","source_cn":"小孩子很容易情绪化。他落泪的时候，我的心也如刀绞。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x909D939756B94341","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1322057021:0":{"text":"でも……ごめんね、ダイモン。ママを許して。これもあなたを守るためなのよ。","source_cn":"但是……对不起，我的孩子，原谅妈妈吧。我必须保护你。","status":"matched","hash